# all.aontu --- the instance: one model, three units, one run.
#
# Each generator contributes a FILE under its own key and the rule set
# that fills it; this document includes the three and lists their files
# as the component tree the engine on the far side writes. One run
# builds the whole set.
#
# The generators are included at the root rather than as values,
# because a document included as a value cannot resolve its own aliases
# (use-cases/BUGS.md 85). Their aliases carry the target's name
# (`%go_record`, `%ts_record`) for the reader's sake rather than the
# engine's: a name belongs to the file that declares it, so two files
# declaring `%record` would now hold two names.
@"./gen-go.aontu"
@"./gen-ts.aontu"
@"./gen-sql.aontu"

out: [$.go $.ts $.sql]
